// Host test for the visionOS game-data validator and import transaction
// (visionos/GameData/GXGameDataValidator.*, GXGameDataInstall.*).
//
// Every fixture is a synthetic tree of tiny fabricated .big files with valid BIGF headers and
// fake content generated by this test. No retail Generals / Zero Hour data is used or shipped.
//
//   vision-gamedata-test                        run the full suite
//   vision-gamedata-test --validate ZH [BASE]   print the validator report for a real or fake
//                                               folder (read-only)
//   vision-gamedata-test --make-fixtures DIR    write the synthetic fixture trees used by the
//                                               simulator checks under DIR
